          "text": "CHU Li 朱理 (T. 燮臣, H. 靜齋), July 13, 1761–1819, Apr. 22, official, was a native of Ching-hsien, Anhwei. He was a son of Chu An-hang 朱安沆 (T. 希靖), but was adopted by his uncle, Chu An-huai 朱安淮 (T. 維揚).",
